Hint:\(\mathrm{I}_{\max }=\left(\sqrt{\mathrm{I}_1}+\sqrt{\mathrm{I}_2}\right)^2
\& ~\mathrm{I}_{\min }=\left(\sqrt{\mathrm{I}_1}-\sqrt{\mathrm{I}_2}\right)^2\)

Step: Find the ratio\(\dfrac{\mathrm{I}_{\max }-\mathrm{I}_{\min
}}{\mathrm{I}_{\max }+\mathrm{I}_{\min }}.\)
Given:\(\frac{I_1}{I_2} = 2x\)
The maximum intensity of the two waves is given by;
\(\mathrm{I}_{\max }=\left(\sqrt{\mathrm{I}_1}+\sqrt{\mathrm{I}_2}\right)^2\)
The minimum intensity of the two waves is given by;
\(\mathrm{I}_{\min }=\left(\sqrt{\mathrm{I}_1}-\sqrt{\mathrm{I}_2}\right)^2\)
Theratio\(\frac{\mathrm{I}_{\max }-\mathrm{I}_{\min }}{\mathrm{I}_{\max
}+\mathrm{I}_{\min }}\)is given by;
\(\frac{\mathrm{I}_{\max }-\mathrm{I}_{\min }}{\mathrm{I}_{\max
}+\mathrm{I}_{\min }}= \frac{(I_1+I_2 +2\sqrt{I_1I_2})- (I_1+I_2
-2\sqrt{I_1I_2})}{(I_1+I_2 +2\sqrt{I_1I_2})+(I_1+I_2 -2\sqrt{I_1I_2})}\)
\(\Rightarrow \frac{\mathrm{I}_{\max }-\mathrm{I}_{\min }}{\mathrm{I}_{\max
}+\mathrm{I}_{\min }}= \frac{2\sqrt{I_1I_2}}{I_1+I_2} =
\frac{2\sqrt{\frac{I_1}{I_2}}}{\frac{I_1}{I_2}+1} \)
\(\Rightarrow \frac{\mathrm{I}_{\max }-\mathrm{I}_{\min }}{\mathrm{I}_{\max
}+\mathrm{I}_{\min }}= \frac{2\sqrt{2x}}{2x+1}\)
Hence, option (4) is the correct answer.<div style="margin-top:1.25rem; padding:0.85rem 1rem; background:var(--bg-secondary); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px;"><div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.6rem; font-weight:600; font-size:0.88rem;"><span>📊 Student Attempt Analytics</span><span style="padding:2px 8px; border-radius:12px; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; background:rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color:#d97706;">🟡 Medium · 67% Got This Correct</span></div><div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:0.5rem; text-align:center; font-size:0.82rem;"><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(1)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">10%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(2)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">15%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(3)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">9%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:rgba(34,197,94,0.12); border:1.5px solid #22c55e;"><div style="color:#16a34a; font-weight:700;">(4) ✓</div><div style="font-weight:800; color:#16a34a; margin-top:2px;">68%</div></div></div></div>
